-### PF-MB-1 · Mandelbrot hot FP loop refuses vectorization (1.67×)
-54 vs gcc 55 static insns but 1 vs 9 packed-double. Reproducer:
-`tests/benchmark/programs/mandelbrot.c`. Done = refusal triage →
